| `evidence.schema` | string | `config/evidence/gate-record.schema.json` | a repo-relative path to a JSON Schema | `scripts/gate_evidence.py` | Names the schema the record cites; the writer takes the record's `schema_version` from its `schema_version.const`, and a schema the loader refuses is CONFIG (exit 14), or USAGE (exit 2) for a conflict hunk. A missing schema or one without an integer version is USAGE. | the version itself, which only the schema file states | always |
